'''''Strife, Dispel the Accompanying Fears''''' is a [[Trailblaze Mission]] in the chapter [[Light Slips the Gate, Shadow Greets the Throne]].

==Steps==
# Seek out Phainon and Dan Heng
# Check Chartonus' current condition
# Find the battle cries and find the source of Strife
# Follow the escaping soldier and investigate the commotion

